{"reviewId": "11900993_86jUyQOYB", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "专门点进来看看大家的反应，因为我也是认同这句话的。现在是2026年1月，目前感受依然是资产荒，我在思考，是不是中国3，40年的房地产带动经济向上发展，现在房地产下跌的趋势依然存在。老百姓那么多年已经习惯了在房地产里面拿到肯定的正向反馈。而一旦下跌后，外加银行稳定的收益如此低，老百姓一下子不知道自己手里的钱放哪儿了。我目前的认知，按照西方发达国家的发展趋势，股市是唯一的选择。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "2646-2732", "abstract": "我看2015年大家讨论资产荒，资产荒就是我钱多，但是没有收益率，这是很危险的信号，这是一个转折点。转折点意味着未来四五年总体的资产收益率不仅让我们赚不到钱，甚至可能会亏损。", "type": 1, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 1, "chapterUid": 23, "chapterName": "18 演讲实录：人生就是一场康波", "chapterIdx": 23, "reviewId": "11900993_86jUyQOYB", "userVid": 11900993, "topics": [], "createTime": 1768981556, "flag": 1073741824, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "18 演讲实录：人生就是一场康波", "author": {"userVid": 11900993, "name": "silver", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/Yc2tpkicn7DPlLMZdsHHek3CwRyvJ874QZptc67DlhdpnrJlZhIclv6cuCFZgd7mqt6DT1SZBsMU/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "silver", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20231113-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 5, "likes": [{"userVid": 87977234, "name": "许力文", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0010-HgxUjOExMQ~g6eyFSpT0s10/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20250113-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}], "commentsCount": 2, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "有没有